//! Golden differential tests against the Go implementation (fixtures generated by
//! `go run -mod=vendor ./hack/golden/dpuservicetemplate crates/ctrl-dpuservicetemplate/tests/fixtures`).
//!
//! Each scenario runs [`DPUServiceTemplateManager`] / [`DPUServiceTemplateReconciler`] against
//! `ctrlrt-fake` with the same inputs as the Go program (a fake `ReleaseImageReader`, release
//! images on an in-process rules registry serving the fixture's responses) and compares every
//! step's error string and release-reader calls, and the `encoding/json` bytes of the three
//! stored DPUServiceTemplates (the objects created on the cluster).
//!
//! `release_reader.json` replays `RemoteReleaseImageReader::get_component_image` against
//! release payload images (manifests, configs and gzip layers produced by Go) and compares
//! results and error strings.
//!
//! Normalization (as in the Go generator): the registry address is replaced by "REGISTRY", and
//! a stored template's deletionTimestamp (`metav1.Now()` stamped by the fake client on Delete)
//! is set to 2025-01-01T00:00:00Z.

